7/README.md"},"document":null,"weights":null},"links":[{"rel":"primary","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/figai/GUI-Perturbed"}],"name":"GUI-Perturbed","notes":"The card YAML at revision 727c857b lists one eval split of 3,120 examples in four Parquet shards, with screenshot, instruction, gt_bbox, visual_variant, instruction_type, task_id and step_index fields. Hugging Face dataset-viewer statistics show 780 rows for each of four visual variants (labelled original, style, precision and text_shrink; the card calls the first one baseline) and 1,560 rows for each of the direct and relational instruction types, so the card's per-variant sample size of 390 covers one instruction type. The card designates the set for evaluation and asks that it be reserved from training; the pages come from Mind2Web MHTML archives. eval.yaml names point-in-bbox accuracy. The card declares CC BY 4.0 for the dataset.","published_at":null,"relations":[{"evidence_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/figai/GUI-Perturbed/raw/727c857bcf7cf3b4077773aefd6e3ab8295c0ed7/README.md","target_id":"github:osu-nlp-group/mind2web","type":"uses"},{"evidence_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/figai/GUI-Perturbed/raw/727c857bcf7cf3b4077773aefd6e3ab8295c0ed7/README.md","target_id":"arxiv:2604.14262","type":"documented_by"}],"review_status":"curated","scope":"core","summary":"Step-level web grounding benchmark that re-renders Mind2Web pages with style, zoom and text-size perturbations and pairs each screenshot with a direct or relational instruction and a target box.","task_classes":["R01.10.01.04"],"topics":["grounding","evaluation","robustness"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/figai/GUI-Perturbed"}
